## Compiled object files ##
*.slo
*.lo
*.o
*.obj

## Compiled Dynamic libraries ##
*.so
*.dylib
*.dll

## Compiled Static libraries ##
*.lai
*.la
*.a
*.lib

## Executables ##
*.exe
*.exe~
*.out
*.app
*.bin

## node
node_modules

## Windows ##
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
*.cab
*.msi
*.msm
*.msp

## Mac ##
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
._*
:w
:q
# Icon must ends with two \r.
Icon


